                                "sense_id": "1975323d-5081-3894-9c95-32f86621b200",
                                "text": "Two planes drawn through the vertex of the cone parallel to the plane of the circular base , and that of a subcontrary section, are called by Chasles the cyclic planes of the cone"
                            }
                        ]
